WEBVTT

00:12.000 --> 00:14.560
♪Trapped in this tiny world♪

00:15.040 --> 00:18.440
♪I'm crushed into dust♪

00:19.200 --> 00:23.000
♪I meddle around without any mercy♪

00:23.320 --> 00:26.160
♪I'm my own pawn♪

00:26.520 --> 00:30.360
♪I sigh at my fate♪

00:30.560 --> 00:35.360
♪Numerous people are under my control♪

00:38.040 --> 00:41.880
♪All the sand is washed away♪

00:44.280 --> 00:47.880
♪An old dream fades♪

00:50.200 --> 00:54.560
♪A bumpy path lies ahead♪

00:56.040 --> 00:58.880
♪Traps within traps, I never make mistakes♪

00:59.200 --> 01:02.000
♪I take a risk at every step♪

01:02.280 --> 01:07.400
♪Even in disputes, I break through with my life♪

01:07.880 --> 01:10.280
♪Schemes within schemes, I prison myself♪

01:10.520 --> 01:13.600
♪Each link swaps bluff and truth♪

01:13.920 --> 01:16.480
♪The world is my Weiqi game board♪

01:16.800 --> 01:22.120
♪Everything's just fleeting♪

01:23.720 --> 01:28.320
♪The play begins♪

01:30.280 --> 01:32.520
♪No return is expected♪

01:32.880 --> 01:37.880
♪The flame is gone, whether we win or lose♪

01:38.280 --> 01:40.360
♪The wind never ceases. I hold the reins♪

01:40.360 --> 01:41.480
[Ashes To Crown]

01:41.480 --> 01:45.680
[Adapted from Xixing's novel, Empress of the State of Chu]

01:46.470 --> 01:49.000
[Episode 16]

02:06.640 --> 02:10.200
[Luocheng]

02:11.460 --> 02:11.860
Your Highness,

02:12.100 --> 02:12.940
Luocheng is less than 100 li

02:12.940 --> 02:13.580
from the Capital.

02:14.700 --> 02:15.900
I shall grant the local noble families

02:15.980 --> 02:17.780
three days to present themselves.

02:18.340 --> 02:19.300
I intend to entrust

02:19.900 --> 02:20.700
the administration

02:21.020 --> 02:22.340
of this city to their heirs.

02:22.780 --> 02:23.220
Naturally,

02:24.020 --> 02:24.860
you know how to deal with those

02:25.020 --> 02:26.020
who defy our orders.

02:26.740 --> 02:27.340
Rest assured, Your Highness.

02:27.660 --> 02:28.460
Mr. Ning has provided the roster

02:28.460 --> 02:29.500
of the noble families along our route.

02:29.900 --> 02:30.940
I guarantee not a single soul shall escape.

02:31.820 --> 02:33.020
How many troops do we have ahead?

02:34.100 --> 02:35.460
The prefecture holds about twenty thousand garrisoned troops,

02:35.820 --> 02:36.980
and the Capital is deploying reinforcements.

02:37.420 --> 02:38.300
Yet, they pose no true threat.

02:38.620 --> 02:39.460
Should they resist,

02:39.660 --> 02:40.420
we shall crush them in a battle

02:40.820 --> 02:41.980
and march straight into the Capital.

02:42.700 --> 02:43.180
Furthermore,

02:43.620 --> 02:44.340
there are a few other matters.

02:44.900 --> 02:45.260
Speak.

02:45.860 --> 02:47.420
The Grand Princess has entered the Prince of Xiaonan's Residence alone.

02:47.660 --> 02:48.460
She is leveraging Your Highness's life

02:48.940 --> 02:49.740
to demand His Lordship's retreat.

02:55.460 --> 02:56.580
She likely fails to realize

02:58.580 --> 03:00.180
how ruthless the imperial family can be.

03:00.900 --> 03:01.660
In the struggle for power,

03:01.980 --> 03:02.900
even the bonds of blood

03:03.860 --> 03:04.980
are nothing but pawns

03:04.980 --> 03:06.100
to be sacrificed.

03:06.860 --> 03:08.020
Did she truly believe

03:08.100 --> 03:09.140
she could threaten Father?

03:10.860 --> 03:11.700
Secret intelligence from the Capital

03:12.020 --> 03:13.060
reports that Xie Yanfang has drafted

03:13.140 --> 03:14.420
an imperial edict to condemn Chu Lan's clan,

03:14.940 --> 03:15.940
but has yet to issue it.

03:21.220 --> 03:22.940
What a ruthless man

03:22.940 --> 03:24.340
he is.

03:26.780 --> 03:28.260
Zhao has evidently misplaced her trust.

03:29.780 --> 03:30.740
The moment Chu Ling perished,

03:31.580 --> 03:33.220
Xie began making a blood sacrifice of the Chu Family.

03:33.740 --> 03:35.380
There is another matter.

03:37.540 --> 03:38.420
Chu Lan and his family

03:39.300 --> 03:39.940
have vanished.

03:42.940 --> 03:43.620
They fled?

03:47.780 --> 03:48.420
That serves us well.

03:49.380 --> 03:51.100
Had Chu Lan remained in the Capital,

03:51.740 --> 03:53.100
he would have become a constraint upon us.

03:54.940 --> 03:55.660
Nonetheless,

03:55.900 --> 03:57.220
that idiot is far too incompetent

03:57.220 --> 03:58.580
to have fled the Capital on his own.

03:59.740 --> 04:01.340
Chu Zhao must have orchestrated this in secret.

04:02.220 --> 04:02.900
What then is our course?

04:04.780 --> 04:05.620
It is best that this leverage

04:05.620 --> 04:06.700
remains in our hands.

04:06.980 --> 04:07.500
Dispatch the order

04:08.340 --> 04:09.500
to seal all primary routes.

04:10.060 --> 04:11.660
Chu Lan and his family must be apprehended.

04:12.620 --> 04:13.100
Understood.

04:16.700 --> 04:17.140
Mr. Deng,

04:17.660 --> 04:18.780
the Xiaonan Army

04:19.060 --> 04:20.140
is now less than a hundred li from the Capital.

04:20.460 --> 04:22.060
The people along the way are flocking to their ranks.

04:22.460 --> 04:23.340
I fear this might lead to trouble.

04:25.460 --> 04:26.180
Where is the minister dispatched

04:26.180 --> 04:27.780
to deliver the imperial edict to Xiao Xun?

04:28.260 --> 04:28.940
There has been no word

04:29.060 --> 04:30.780
from him to this day.

04:33.300 --> 04:34.540
Xie Yanfang's suspicion was correct.

04:35.500 --> 04:36.820
The dispatch riders were a ruse.

04:38.220 --> 04:40.060
It appears Xiao Xun intends to use this pretext

04:40.540 --> 04:42.100
to force his entry into the Capital and stage a coup.

04:42.420 --> 04:44.700
Xiao Xun has been disseminating rumors along his march,

04:44.860 --> 04:45.420
claiming

04:46.100 --> 04:47.780
he comes to defend His Majesty by command.

04:48.060 --> 04:50.740
He is clearly exploiting public sentiment

04:50.860 --> 04:52.740
to mislead the people.

04:52.900 --> 04:54.020
That is precisely my greatest fear

04:54.260 --> 04:55.300
that the people of the Capital

04:55.660 --> 04:56.700
will also be swayed by his deception.

04:57.140 --> 04:58.580
You must formulate a strategy without delay, Mr. Deng.

04:59.260 --> 05:01.560
If he continues deceiving the people...

05:01.800 --> 05:02.320
Mr. Deng!

05:02.780 --> 05:03.340
Mr. Deng!

05:04.220 --> 05:04.780
Mr. Deng.

05:06.060 --> 05:06.940
Please review this.

05:13.980 --> 05:14.940
Her Highness has entered

05:14.940 --> 05:15.820
the Prince of Xiaonan's Residence alone,

05:15.860 --> 05:16.660
seeking to negotiate their surrender.

05:16.660 --> 05:17.520
[The Grand Princess entered Prince of Xiaonan's Residence to urge surrender.]

05:18.780 --> 05:19.780
A diversion to relieve the Capital?

05:21.660 --> 05:23.060
Her Highness has truly grown far more audacious

05:23.060 --> 05:24.100
than before.

05:28.740 --> 05:29.500
Where is Mr. Xie?

05:29.820 --> 05:30.500
Mr. Deng!

05:30.860 --> 05:31.580
Mr. Deng!

05:33.740 --> 05:34.300
Mr. Deng,

05:34.580 --> 05:35.140
a matter of concern has arisen.

05:35.300 --> 05:35.900
Mr. Xie intends to depart

05:36.020 --> 05:37.060
with His Majesty.

05:37.860 --> 05:38.220
What?

05:39.060 --> 05:39.580
- What? - What?

05:39.580 --> 05:40.620
This is preposterous.

05:40.900 --> 05:42.380
He means to flee with His Majesty.

05:42.700 --> 05:43.580
Ludicrous.

05:47.260 --> 05:49.340
His Majesty arrives!

06:05.020 --> 06:05.620
Mr. Xie,

06:07.220 --> 06:08.460
where are you escorting

06:08.460 --> 06:09.260
His Majesty?

06:09.980 --> 06:11.100
I am escorting His Majesty

06:12.020 --> 06:13.100
to lead the campaign.

06:13.780 --> 06:15.300
Absolutely impermissible!

06:15.300 --> 06:15.900
This must not be allowed!

06:15.900 --> 06:17.740
Cease this folly, Mr. Xie!

06:18.140 --> 06:18.820
Mr. Xie,

06:19.820 --> 06:21.540
are you aware of the sheer peril

06:21.540 --> 06:22.860
of our present circumstances?

06:23.060 --> 06:24.260
That's the precise reason

06:24.940 --> 06:26.580
why His Majesty must lead the army.

06:27.620 --> 06:28.260
The Lord of Xiaonan

06:28.740 --> 06:29.780
and his son

06:30.100 --> 06:31.740
are his sworn enemies.

06:32.060 --> 06:32.580
It is only right

06:32.580 --> 06:34.260
that His Majesty avenge his parents.

06:34.620 --> 06:35.180
As the one who sits

06:35.820 --> 06:36.940
on the throne,

06:37.380 --> 06:38.860
he must prioritize the state.

06:39.780 --> 06:41.380
Now that the rebels are misleading the people,

06:41.740 --> 06:43.180
only the announcement

06:43.180 --> 06:43.780
of an imperial campaign

06:44.260 --> 06:45.300
can lay bare

06:45.340 --> 06:46.460
their true intentions.

06:47.380 --> 06:48.540
Should the Lord of Xiaonan and his son

06:48.700 --> 06:49.500
retreat,

06:50.700 --> 06:51.980
His Majesty's campaign

06:52.620 --> 06:53.540
shall be directed against the Northern Desert.

06:54.300 --> 06:55.180
Should they refuse to withdraw,

06:56.060 --> 06:57.340
then His Majesty is crusading to suppress

06:58.100 --> 06:59.820
the Xiaonan rebels.

07:01.780 --> 07:02.220
Mr. Deng,

07:03.300 --> 07:04.260
His Majesty and I

07:05.420 --> 07:06.500
await your imperial edict.

07:22.860 --> 07:24.500
Now that Xie Yanfang has entered the board,

07:24.820 --> 07:25.780
this game

07:27.020 --> 07:29.180
must finally yield a victor.

07:31.540 --> 07:32.740
The Lord of Xiaonan always presumed this

07:32.740 --> 07:34.220
to be his opportunity,

07:36.140 --> 07:37.180
yet he fails to see

07:38.780 --> 07:41.060
that it is Xie Yanfang's opportunity as well.

07:57.060 --> 07:58.060
Mr. Chu, where are you heading

07:58.060 --> 07:59.100
in such a rush?

08:00.020 --> 08:01.460
His Highness requests your presence.

08:21.300 --> 08:21.980
Please,

08:22.260 --> 08:23.140
have mercy.

08:23.260 --> 08:23.940
My family

08:24.180 --> 08:25.180
has never held any grievance

08:25.380 --> 08:26.820
against His Highness.

08:26.940 --> 08:27.740
We beg you

08:28.020 --> 08:29.140
to show clemency.

08:32.260 --> 08:33.420
It's been a long time since we last met.

08:34.700 --> 08:35.500
Mr. Chu,

08:36.260 --> 08:37.500
why do you appear so haggard?

08:37.900 --> 08:39.260
It seems Her Highness

08:40.020 --> 08:41.020
has been remiss in her care

08:41.460 --> 08:42.380
for your family.

08:42.700 --> 08:43.500
Your Highness,

08:44.100 --> 08:45.820
I was truly driven to despair.

08:46.260 --> 08:47.060
I had thought

08:47.340 --> 08:48.660
I could survive

08:48.660 --> 08:49.580
by playing the fool.

08:50.020 --> 08:51.340
Yet the court refuses

08:51.540 --> 08:53.220
to grant me life

08:53.740 --> 08:55.100
because of what happened back then.

08:55.500 --> 08:56.940
Are you

08:57.980 --> 08:59.220
blaming me?

09:00.300 --> 09:00.820
I would not dare,

09:00.940 --> 09:01.420
Your Highness.

09:01.540 --> 09:02.220
I swear

09:02.380 --> 09:02.780
I would never dare.

09:02.780 --> 09:03.340
Your Highness.

09:03.700 --> 09:04.740
Rest assured.

09:05.820 --> 09:06.660
I'm

09:06.660 --> 09:07.780
not that heartless.

09:08.460 --> 09:09.220
You may stay

09:09.740 --> 09:12.380
in Luocheng for now.

09:13.060 --> 09:13.980
Once I enter the imperial city

09:14.380 --> 09:15.260
and present myself to His Majesty,

09:16.300 --> 09:18.220
I shall clear your name.

09:18.580 --> 09:19.220
I appreciate it, Your Highness.

09:19.220 --> 09:19.700
My deepest gratitude.

09:19.780 --> 09:20.820
I am profoundly grateful.

09:20.820 --> 09:21.660
Thank you.

09:23.380 --> 09:24.340
Miss Tang,

09:24.980 --> 09:26.140
are you willing to assist me

09:26.940 --> 09:27.900
on behalf of your father?

09:29.340 --> 09:30.220
Miss Tang,

09:30.540 --> 09:32.460
you ingratiated yourself with the noble families,

09:33.180 --> 09:33.980
keeping a sharp eye on the shifting winds,

09:35.140 --> 09:36.260
and the second trouble brewed,

09:36.900 --> 09:37.860
you didn't hesitate

09:38.300 --> 09:40.100
to take your parents and flee the Capital.

09:41.100 --> 09:41.860
Am I correct?

09:42.580 --> 09:44.180
I did hear some news.

09:44.620 --> 09:46.180
Where did you get it?

09:46.940 --> 09:47.500
Zhao

09:48.500 --> 09:50.220
brought the word to me.

09:54.020 --> 09:56.060
You two share a remarkably deep bond.

09:56.500 --> 09:57.540
Her Highness

09:57.980 --> 09:59.500
could still convey tidings to you

10:00.100 --> 10:01.900
from thousands of li away.

10:03.380 --> 10:04.460
Yet do you realize

10:04.660 --> 10:05.620
that your flight

10:06.500 --> 10:08.380
only serves to substantiate the allegations

10:08.380 --> 10:10.180
the court leveled against you?

10:11.500 --> 10:12.340
If my father

10:13.100 --> 10:13.980
ascends the throne,

10:14.500 --> 10:15.460
I shall be the Crown Prince.

10:18.260 --> 10:19.260
Miss Tang,

10:21.660 --> 10:22.780
would you like to be the Crown Princess?

10:31.020 --> 10:32.740
[Xiaonan Prefecture]
Masterful play to turn the tables,

10:32.740 --> 10:33.740
Your Highness.

10:35.100 --> 10:37.380
Did you truly believe a worthless fool like Chu Lan

10:37.380 --> 10:38.940
could ever approach my son?

10:39.300 --> 10:40.500
Xiao Xun has suffered three defeats at my hands.

10:41.780 --> 10:43.740
He will never hesitate to strike when he spots an opening.

10:45.740 --> 10:47.020
He will take the bait, even fully aware.

10:47.460 --> 10:49.180
Since Your Highness knows my son so well,

10:49.660 --> 10:50.460
why

10:50.620 --> 10:51.660
did you sabotage

10:51.780 --> 10:53.580
such an ideal alliance back then?

10:54.380 --> 10:56.020
To hunt, one must truly know the prey.

10:56.460 --> 10:57.060
However,

10:57.660 --> 10:59.540
I place no faith in hollow affection.

11:00.740 --> 11:02.460
I trust only the blade in my hand.

11:06.020 --> 11:06.900
What a pity.

11:07.740 --> 11:09.420
A fence-sitter like Chu Lan

11:09.620 --> 11:11.500
is unworthy of being your blade.

11:12.140 --> 11:13.900
You ought to know

11:13.980 --> 11:14.820
your uncle, Your Highness.

11:15.380 --> 11:16.980
Even if he gained access to my son,

11:17.500 --> 11:19.140
a coward of his measure

11:19.860 --> 11:22.140
could never achieve anything of note.

11:22.540 --> 11:23.740
How can Your Lordship be certain

11:24.260 --> 11:25.300
I have nothing left up my sleeve?

11:25.780 --> 11:26.500
I am aware.

11:27.500 --> 11:28.780
Your cousin.

11:29.620 --> 11:30.740
Your Highness seems to forget

11:31.460 --> 11:33.460
that despite your boasted detachment,

11:33.980 --> 11:35.620
you still lost your heart to my son.

11:36.500 --> 11:38.940
Let alone Chu Tang.

11:39.620 --> 11:40.260
Your Highness,

11:41.020 --> 11:42.420
you might as well concede.

11:47.020 --> 11:47.940
Your Highness.

11:50.100 --> 11:51.940
What... is it you require of me?

11:52.220 --> 11:53.140
Chu Zhao

11:53.860 --> 11:54.740
is besieging Xiaonan

11:55.140 --> 11:56.500
with her forces.

11:56.900 --> 11:57.660
Therefore,

11:58.460 --> 11:59.660
I'd like you

12:00.260 --> 12:01.300
to persuade her,

12:02.540 --> 12:03.500
so as to guarantee my father's safety.

12:03.980 --> 12:05.100
Your Highness,

12:05.860 --> 12:06.300
how

12:07.140 --> 12:08.700
could I possibly achieve this?

12:09.380 --> 12:11.100
Zhao is the Grand Princess.

12:12.260 --> 12:12.660
How

12:13.740 --> 12:15.580
could someone like me ever persuade her?

12:17.140 --> 12:18.100
Miss Tang,

12:18.620 --> 12:19.940
you live as you please,

12:20.380 --> 12:21.780
even through hard times.

12:22.620 --> 12:23.540
Though Chu Zhao

12:24.260 --> 12:25.300
may be wary

12:26.020 --> 12:26.740
and guard against you,

12:27.380 --> 12:28.300
I remain confident

12:29.460 --> 12:30.500
that you know

12:30.540 --> 12:31.460
how to win her trust.

12:32.860 --> 12:34.940
Everyone praises Chu Zhao's valor

12:35.420 --> 12:37.180
on the battlefield.

12:38.180 --> 12:38.980
But the truth is,

12:40.300 --> 12:41.660
maneuvering through human minds

12:42.420 --> 12:43.460
takes an even greater hero.

12:44.980 --> 12:45.460
Chu Tang,

12:46.260 --> 12:46.980
do you wish

12:47.140 --> 12:48.300
to stand above all others

12:49.460 --> 12:50.700
and be revered by the entire world?

12:56.740 --> 12:57.460
Your Highness.

12:59.980 --> 13:01.260
Will you truly marry me?

13:02.500 --> 13:03.700
A father's eye sees

13:04.420 --> 13:05.740
only perfection.

13:06.700 --> 13:07.940
There is a kind of person

13:08.580 --> 13:09.620
who is the hardest to sway.

13:10.620 --> 13:11.620
Take my cousin for instance.

13:12.380 --> 13:13.700
She trusts nothing

13:14.460 --> 13:15.820
she cannot hold for herself.

13:17.220 --> 13:18.620
She cares nothing for mere charm,

13:19.220 --> 13:20.180
only for propriety.

13:21.180 --> 13:21.700
Propriety?

13:22.100 --> 13:24.020
And by what standard

13:24.100 --> 13:25.620
does Your Highness gauge her heart?

13:26.300 --> 13:28.260
Besides, what my son is best at

13:28.300 --> 13:30.220
is turning the desires of others

13:30.300 --> 13:32.140
into playthings in his own hands.

13:33.140 --> 13:34.060
You should be

13:34.900 --> 13:36.380
well aware of this.

13:37.700 --> 13:38.820
What truly moves people

13:38.900 --> 13:40.260
in this world

13:40.700 --> 13:43.060
is nothing more than profit and sincerity,

13:43.540 --> 13:45.100
and my son possesses both.

13:46.180 --> 13:47.060
Your Highness,

13:47.780 --> 13:50.220
how much can you offer your cousin?

13:56.740 --> 13:59.060
But I am not like Chu Zhao.

13:59.900 --> 14:00.740
She commands the frontier,

14:01.140 --> 14:01.940
with an army at her back.

14:02.780 --> 14:03.820
A shared surname means nothing.

14:05.220 --> 14:07.380
I am of no use to your grand designs, Your Highness.

14:08.020 --> 14:08.700
Do you know

14:09.820 --> 14:10.500
that the hardest thing

14:11.260 --> 14:12.340
to fathom

14:12.900 --> 14:13.700
is not power,

14:15.260 --> 14:15.980
but sincerity?

14:17.220 --> 14:18.180
Just like

14:19.380 --> 14:20.460
how I used to feel about Chu Zhao.

14:21.140 --> 14:22.900
Since Your Highness cared for her,

14:25.540 --> 14:26.580
why have you come

14:27.700 --> 14:28.660
to me?

14:28.980 --> 14:29.860
Because she does not trust me

14:31.140 --> 14:32.020
and even tried to kill me.

14:34.060 --> 14:35.620
I believe you are different from her

14:37.340 --> 14:39.140
and would never treat my sincerity

14:39.780 --> 14:40.540
as dirt,

14:41.300 --> 14:41.820
right?

14:45.700 --> 14:47.060
Since I have been upfront with you,

14:48.460 --> 14:49.660
I will make things perfectly clear.

14:50.380 --> 14:50.980
Seeking

14:51.580 --> 14:52.460
to marry Zhao back then

14:53.700 --> 14:54.340
might have been for interest,

14:54.900 --> 14:55.500
but

14:56.340 --> 14:57.340
seeking your help

14:58.780 --> 14:59.540
is for my father.

15:01.100 --> 15:03.140
My father staked everything on me,

15:03.540 --> 15:04.740
and is now trapped in a dire situation.

15:05.220 --> 15:06.100
If you could write

15:07.500 --> 15:09.540
a letter to sway Chu Zhao into retreat,

15:11.220 --> 15:11.780
I will never forget

15:12.980 --> 15:14.460
this kindness.

15:16.140 --> 15:16.980
Your Highness, there is no need for this.

15:18.620 --> 15:19.180
Look.

15:19.540 --> 15:21.820
Such devotion to His Lordship.

15:22.220 --> 15:23.220
Not a soul alive

15:23.380 --> 15:24.740
could ever doubt it.

15:25.780 --> 15:26.620
Miss Tang,

15:28.020 --> 15:28.900
are you willing to help me?

15:35.740 --> 15:36.660
Miss Chu,

15:37.740 --> 15:39.660
this game is all but lost.

15:45.580 --> 15:47.180
Then I shall wager on the wild variable.

15:49.540 --> 15:50.820
Since Your Lordship cannot crush

15:51.140 --> 15:52.180
me yet,

15:53.060 --> 15:54.460
shall we play another match?

15:56.300 --> 15:56.900
What are we gambling on?

15:57.740 --> 15:58.740
Whether a simple snare

15:58.740 --> 15:59.780
of tenderness

16:00.340 --> 16:01.220
can shatter

16:01.220 --> 16:03.060
your son's rotten pretense.

16:10.660 --> 16:11.260
Your Highness,

16:13.460 --> 16:14.100
does it really...

16:16.100 --> 16:18.900
take only a fraction of this poison...

16:20.740 --> 16:22.780
to claim a life?

16:23.780 --> 16:25.100
I have lived a guarded life

16:25.900 --> 16:27.140
and have never killed anyone.

16:28.700 --> 16:29.260
I am afraid.

16:31.300 --> 16:32.660
There is an exception to everything.

16:35.020 --> 16:36.260
I believe you, Miss Tang.

16:37.180 --> 16:37.820
After all,

16:39.220 --> 16:40.420
the dagger in your sleeve

16:40.500 --> 16:41.740
is far deadlier than this poison.

16:44.340 --> 16:44.820
Darling.

16:52.940 --> 16:55.100
What a fine dagger of meteoric iron.

16:57.180 --> 16:57.900
Tell me.

16:58.660 --> 16:59.100
Tang.

16:59.460 --> 17:00.900
Should I test the blade

17:00.900 --> 17:01.780
on your father first?

17:04.780 --> 17:05.260
No!

17:05.300 --> 17:05.700
Your Highness,

17:06.260 --> 17:07.580
I am willing to kill Chu Zhao

17:07.860 --> 17:08.820
for your sake.

17:08.940 --> 17:09.740
Your Highness, please spare my life.

17:10.220 --> 17:10.660
Your Highness.

17:10.980 --> 17:12.140
Miss Tang,

17:12.820 --> 17:14.580
you have deceived me once.

17:15.260 --> 17:15.900
I will obey,

17:16.100 --> 17:17.340
Your Highness.

17:17.860 --> 17:18.860
Please spare my father.

17:18.940 --> 17:19.380
Your Highness.

17:19.620 --> 17:20.820
Please spare my life.

17:23.540 --> 17:24.180
- Come here. - Father.

17:25.140 --> 17:25.580
Come.

17:29.180 --> 17:30.500
You said you would obey, didn't you?

17:30.980 --> 17:31.500
Get up.

17:33.300 --> 17:34.300
I told you to come here.

17:34.620 --> 17:35.140
Hold it!

17:36.820 --> 17:37.740
Just like this.

17:38.020 --> 17:38.460
No.

17:38.660 --> 17:39.140
Tang.

17:41.020 --> 17:42.380
Show Chu Zhao...

17:42.380 --> 17:42.780
Father.

17:43.220 --> 17:44.060
how ruthless

17:45.940 --> 17:46.980
her cousin can be.

17:55.340 --> 17:56.220
Whoever dares to move,

17:56.660 --> 17:57.580
I will kill him.

17:59.820 --> 18:01.100
You taught me well, Your Highness.

18:02.700 --> 18:04.340
Did I look the part​

18:04.980 --> 18:06.020
when I raised my blade against my father?

18:13.500 --> 18:14.780
Surrender now!

18:16.740 --> 18:18.540
Take one step closer,

18:18.980 --> 18:20.500
and I will flay Xiao Xun alive.

18:21.340 --> 18:22.900
Back away,

18:23.180 --> 18:24.260
unless you want

18:24.660 --> 18:26.060
to watch him suffer.

18:27.620 --> 18:28.100
Wait.

18:29.060 --> 18:29.940
Tang,

18:30.460 --> 18:31.460
do you know what you are doing

18:31.460 --> 18:32.140
right now?

18:32.500 --> 18:34.180
Release His Highness,

18:34.340 --> 18:35.180
now.

18:35.500 --> 18:35.980
Father,

18:36.380 --> 18:37.340
did you forget

18:37.380 --> 18:38.180
he was trying to kill you just now?

18:38.300 --> 18:39.300
I...

18:42.900 --> 18:43.460
Your Highness,

18:44.660 --> 18:45.740
where is your private seal?

18:46.900 --> 18:48.540
In the ruyi sachet inside my sleeve.

18:50.940 --> 18:52.380
Brilliant, Miss Tang.

18:53.860 --> 18:55.060
You even kept your parents in the dark.

18:59.900 --> 19:00.540
Your Highness,

19:01.100 --> 19:02.900
your seal is truly beautiful.

19:07.580 --> 19:08.980
Your Highness, I beg your forgiveness

19:09.820 --> 19:11.100
for failing to realize that their servant

19:11.140 --> 19:12.020
was an assassin in disguise.

19:21.340 --> 19:22.980
I did not mean to hide it.

19:23.980 --> 19:25.660
My parents are of a gentle nature,

19:26.660 --> 19:27.860
and I feared the truth

19:29.340 --> 19:30.220
would terrify them.

19:32.340 --> 19:33.700
What did Chu Zhao promise you?

19:34.180 --> 19:35.740
Promises?

19:36.220 --> 19:37.660
We are family.

19:38.100 --> 19:39.340
If she falls,

19:39.820 --> 19:41.140
so will I.

19:42.060 --> 19:42.860
My hand

19:44.100 --> 19:45.140
was forced.

19:45.460 --> 19:47.020
It seems that, compared to Chu Zhao,

19:47.500 --> 19:48.740
I still haven't done enough

19:48.740 --> 19:50.100
to make you believe

19:50.820 --> 19:51.780
that my promise

19:52.780 --> 19:54.220
to make you Empress

19:54.220 --> 19:54.940
was genuine.

19:55.940 --> 19:58.020
You have come from a humble background.

19:58.180 --> 19:59.740
If I ascend the throne,

20:00.140 --> 20:01.900
we would be a perfect match.

20:02.740 --> 20:04.620
​Why bow to her command?​

20:06.660 --> 20:07.340
Or

20:08.140 --> 20:09.420
do you think yourself unfit

20:10.060 --> 20:10.980
to be Empress,

20:11.820 --> 20:12.940
and that the only difference

20:13.820 --> 20:14.780
between you and her

20:14.780 --> 20:15.860
is a powerful father?

20:18.780 --> 20:19.300
My father

20:20.340 --> 20:21.500
is wonderful.

20:21.580 --> 20:22.900
Join me,

20:23.580 --> 20:24.820
and your father will become the Emperor's father-in-law.

20:25.300 --> 20:26.420
I'll offer the military tally as a betrothal gift.

20:26.980 --> 20:27.940
He would hold

20:28.420 --> 20:29.340
far greater power

20:29.820 --> 20:31.100
than he does now.

20:35.380 --> 20:36.100
- Tang. - Tang.

20:39.020 --> 20:39.460
You...!

20:41.940 --> 20:42.380
You wretched woman!

20:43.060 --> 20:43.900
Even His Lordship

20:43.900 --> 20:45.020
never laid a finger on His Highness,

20:45.220 --> 20:45.700
yet you dare to...!

20:46.140 --> 20:47.300
I will tear you to pieces!

20:48.060 --> 20:49.260
Please forgive me, Your Highness.

20:49.940 --> 20:50.780
This is the first time

20:51.020 --> 20:52.900
I have ever struck someone,

20:53.900 --> 20:56.460
but I truly had no choice.

20:56.940 --> 20:57.740
Tang,

20:58.180 --> 20:59.700
you should have let me do it.

21:00.220 --> 21:01.220
I promise I would have made him remember

21:01.460 --> 21:02.420
the pain for the rest of his life.

21:02.940 --> 21:04.660
I didn't do it to hurt him,

21:05.140 --> 21:06.780
nor was I even trying to hit him.

21:07.620 --> 21:08.580
What do you mean?

21:09.020 --> 21:10.180
I slapped him

21:11.340 --> 21:13.140
to burn my own bridges.

21:14.340 --> 21:16.420
The title His Highness promised

21:16.460 --> 21:17.420
was far too tempting.

21:18.540 --> 21:19.700
I was afraid that if I kept listening,

21:20.180 --> 21:22.100
I would actually believe it.

21:23.180 --> 21:23.780
Take this

21:23.780 --> 21:24.900
to Zhao.

21:25.500 --> 21:26.060
If we wait any longer,

21:27.420 --> 21:28.780
I am afraid I might regret it.

21:29.100 --> 21:29.620
In your dreams.

21:30.700 --> 21:32.140
The guards are outside.

21:33.180 --> 21:34.020
You cannot even leave

21:34.020 --> 21:34.780
this room.

21:39.620 --> 21:40.220
Now

21:41.300 --> 21:42.340
I've made a bitter enemy

21:42.340 --> 21:43.380
of His Highness's right-hand man.

21:43.860 --> 21:44.740
I will kill you!

21:48.620 --> 21:49.180
Tang,

21:49.540 --> 21:50.940
what should we do now?

21:51.260 --> 21:52.540
Whether we bind His Highness or not,

21:52.820 --> 21:54.020
death awaits either way.

21:54.700 --> 21:55.380
There is

21:55.620 --> 21:58.420
no way out.

21:59.340 --> 21:59.980
Father,

22:00.540 --> 22:01.220
since it has come to this,

22:01.580 --> 22:02.420
we must fight

22:02.620 --> 22:03.700
for a way to live

22:03.860 --> 22:04.780
where none seems possible.

22:06.700 --> 22:08.260
Zhao wanted me to restrain Xiao Xun

22:09.300 --> 22:10.660
and then await her word.

22:12.540 --> 22:13.220
How certain

22:13.980 --> 22:14.860
are you of this?

22:22.020 --> 22:23.260
The Lord of Xiaonan has seven children,

22:23.900 --> 22:25.420
and Xiao Xun is merely one of them.

22:25.940 --> 22:27.100
To people like him,

22:27.620 --> 22:28.940
flesh and blood mean nothing.

22:29.420 --> 22:30.260
Even if Chu Tang

22:30.260 --> 22:31.260
has restrained Xiao Xun,

22:31.580 --> 22:32.380
it does not mean

22:32.580 --> 22:33.740
the Lord of Xiaonan will back down.

22:38.860 --> 22:39.900
Xiao Xun can die,

22:40.620 --> 22:41.580
but the Lord of Xiaonan

22:42.700 --> 22:44.140
will not relent.

22:44.860 --> 22:45.540
I am aware.

22:46.220 --> 22:46.860
But

22:47.420 --> 22:48.100
let us wait a little longer.

22:48.180 --> 22:49.060
What exactly are we waiting for?

22:54.420 --> 22:55.260
For Xie Yanfang?

22:58.780 --> 22:59.700
For the news that he has brought Yu

23:01.180 --> 23:02.340
to lead the army in person?

23:09.300 --> 23:10.020
You certainly place great faith in him.

23:13.340 --> 23:14.180
Even acting from afar,

23:14.220 --> 23:15.340
the two of you move in perfect accord.

23:17.260 --> 23:18.340
I merely think

23:18.740 --> 23:19.980
he should understand my move.

23:20.300 --> 23:21.220
More than just you.

23:22.660 --> 23:23.780
He understands everyone in the world.

23:25.260 --> 23:26.100
It is hardly surprising

23:26.540 --> 23:27.900
that Xie Yanfang could earn your trust,

23:28.900 --> 23:30.020
Your Highness.

23:32.940 --> 23:34.300
Jiu, you sound like

23:34.620 --> 23:35.220
you are...?

23:35.220 --> 23:36.260
I am reminding you

23:37.380 --> 23:38.500
that Xie Yanfang excels

23:38.500 --> 23:39.380
at claiming the spoils from the shadows.

23:41.460 --> 23:42.660
His help must come

23:44.380 --> 23:45.460
with an ulterior motive.

23:46.700 --> 23:47.580
What of it?

23:49.820 --> 23:50.900
I have no use

23:51.180 --> 23:52.580
for Xie Yanfang's sincerity.

24:31.380 --> 24:33.380
[Xie Residence]

24:39.020 --> 24:39.500
Mr. Xie.

24:47.180 --> 24:47.660
Mr. Xie,

24:48.340 --> 24:49.700
the routed troops from the prefectures

24:49.700 --> 24:50.620
​who are straggling in,

24:50.860 --> 24:52.100
combined with the eighty thousand troops

24:52.100 --> 24:52.820
marching with the imperial expedition,

24:53.180 --> 24:54.380
bring our total strength to about one hundred and fifty thousand.

24:55.020 --> 24:56.060
Although the Lord of Xiaonan claims to have

24:56.060 --> 24:56.900
an army of two hundred thousand,

24:57.260 --> 24:58.060
most

24:58.380 --> 24:59.500
are commoners forced into service

24:59.500 --> 25:00.220
along the way.

25:00.940 --> 25:01.500
Furthermore,

25:02.100 --> 25:03.540
we have thirty thousand of our own men

25:04.020 --> 25:05.420
who have secretly left Gaoyang

25:05.820 --> 25:07.500
and can deliver a fatal blow to the Lord of Xiaonan

25:07.500 --> 25:08.300
at any moment.

25:08.700 --> 25:09.380
Very well.

25:11.500 --> 25:12.180
Pass down the order

25:13.100 --> 25:13.940
to assemble

25:14.100 --> 25:15.180
and prepare to move out.

25:15.380 --> 25:15.820
Yes.

25:16.860 --> 25:18.980
We must not keep Her Highness

25:20.500 --> 25:21.580
waiting.

25:22.140 --> 25:23.260
What perfect accord

25:23.260 --> 25:23.940
between you

25:23.940 --> 25:24.700
and Chu Zhao.

25:25.420 --> 25:26.660
She seized Xiao Xun as a hostage,

25:26.980 --> 25:28.540
and you persuaded His Majesty to lead the campaign.

25:28.980 --> 25:29.780
A masterful chain

25:30.340 --> 25:31.180
of stratagems.

25:32.060 --> 25:33.580
The Lord of Xiaonan's lifelong quest

25:34.420 --> 25:35.420
comes down to just one thing,

25:36.660 --> 25:38.420
a rightful name.

25:39.260 --> 25:40.900
Yet I shall ensure

25:43.700 --> 25:45.540
he loses the moral ground he stands on

25:47.020 --> 25:50.020
and the heart of his son.

25:53.380 --> 25:55.380
[The Capital]

26:17.060 --> 26:18.180
Your Lordship, you do not look

26:18.620 --> 26:19.820
particularly pleased.

26:20.580 --> 26:22.340
Is it because Tang managed

26:23.100 --> 26:24.380
to capture Xiao Xun?

26:25.060 --> 26:26.780
I've often told my son

26:27.300 --> 26:28.700
that to perfect the elixir,

26:29.700 --> 26:31.180
it is all in the timing.

26:32.380 --> 26:34.220
Yet he was too impatient,

26:34.900 --> 26:36.580
letting you gain the upper hand.

26:37.340 --> 26:39.060
But do you truly believe

26:40.740 --> 26:41.860
you have won?

26:42.420 --> 26:43.460
With Xiao Xun captured,

26:44.220 --> 26:46.420
his life is in our hands.

26:47.820 --> 26:49.340
I have one wife

26:49.900 --> 26:50.820
and three concubines,

26:51.540 --> 26:53.660
with seven children in total.

26:54.220 --> 26:55.940
So Your Lordship means

26:56.460 --> 26:58.020
Xiao Xun's survival

26:58.300 --> 26:59.340
is of no consequence?

27:00.780 --> 27:01.540
Xun

27:01.740 --> 27:02.660
is a devoted son.

27:03.740 --> 27:04.460
So

27:05.100 --> 27:06.940
even if it costs him his life,

27:07.940 --> 27:09.100
he would never allow anyone

27:09.100 --> 27:10.140
to use it as leverage

27:10.220 --> 27:11.940
against his father.

27:12.780 --> 27:13.940
After I ascend the throne,

27:14.380 --> 27:15.900
I will honor him as Crown Prince.

27:16.420 --> 27:18.380
How about I name you Crown Princess,

27:18.540 --> 27:19.980
so you may keep him company in the afterlife?

27:24.340 --> 27:25.020
I dare you.

27:32.620 --> 27:33.340
It's true

27:34.300 --> 27:35.540
blood holds no sway in the palace.

27:36.100 --> 27:38.780
Your Highness also waded through blood

27:38.900 --> 27:39.900
in the coup

27:39.940 --> 27:41.980
to reach this position.

27:42.580 --> 27:44.060
Do you think

27:44.140 --> 27:45.300
that capturing Xun

27:45.700 --> 27:47.820
would make me hesitate?

27:58.380 --> 27:59.260
Since Your Lordship

27:59.940 --> 28:01.500
disregards even your son's life,

28:02.620 --> 28:04.060
you must care even less about being labeled

28:04.060 --> 28:04.860
a traitorous rebel.

28:06.300 --> 28:07.460
I received word

28:07.900 --> 28:09.660
that His Majesty is about to lead the army in person.

28:10.460 --> 28:11.340
Can Your Lordship guess

28:12.300 --> 28:14.020
whether the imperial expedition is targeting the Northern Desert

28:14.460 --> 28:16.620
or Xiaonan Prefecture?

28:18.020 --> 28:18.940
If it is the latter,

28:19.180 --> 28:20.420
this treason

28:21.260 --> 28:22.420
can never be absolved.

28:23.620 --> 28:24.540
I promise you

28:25.220 --> 28:26.460
that if you withdraw your troops now,

28:26.980 --> 28:28.460
I can ensure you remain unscathed.

28:33.780 --> 28:35.500
Should you not be begging me

28:35.540 --> 28:36.540
to spare that boy's life

28:36.580 --> 28:37.820
when I ascend the throne?

28:38.340 --> 28:39.820
Or if you submit to me now,

28:40.540 --> 28:42.020
I can spare your life as well.

28:43.620 --> 28:44.340
Xiao Hong,

28:45.700 --> 28:47.420
His Majesty and I have no need for your mercy,

28:47.540 --> 28:48.300
nor will you have the chance

28:48.300 --> 28:49.300
to face His Majesty in battle.

28:51.100 --> 28:52.100
With Xiao Xun captured,

28:52.860 --> 28:54.620
the Xiaonan forces in the Capital

28:54.620 --> 28:55.420
are left without a head,

28:55.580 --> 28:56.700
destined to crumble at the first strike.

28:57.260 --> 28:58.260
The day His Majesty's cavalry

28:58.260 --> 28:59.340
crushes Xiaonan Prefecture,

28:59.500 --> 29:00.180
your treacherous correspondence

29:00.180 --> 29:01.420
with the Northern Desert

29:01.660 --> 29:03.100
will be posted on every city gate.

29:03.740 --> 29:04.260
When the time comes,

29:04.660 --> 29:05.940
the frontier troops of Yunzhong

29:05.940 --> 29:06.620
will be waiting to sever

29:06.620 --> 29:07.900
every head of your clan.

29:08.780 --> 29:10.100
I will have them all displayed,

29:10.100 --> 29:12.300
one by one, atop the city gates,

29:13.020 --> 29:13.780
for all to witness.

29:14.780 --> 29:15.660
The court historians will write

29:15.940 --> 29:17.140
as I command.

29:17.740 --> 29:18.820
The traitor Xiao Hong

29:19.500 --> 29:20.660
is condemned for treason.

29:21.100 --> 29:22.020
His clan shall be exterminated.

29:23.140 --> 29:25.100
Every life in the Prince of Xiaonan's Residence,

29:25.300 --> 29:26.580
and every blade that falls on them,

29:27.180 --> 29:29.260
serve to atone for your infamy.

29:30.540 --> 29:31.260
Did you believe

29:31.620 --> 29:32.660
I captured Xiao Xun

29:32.660 --> 29:33.900
to threaten you?

29:34.820 --> 29:36.180
I want you to know

29:36.700 --> 29:38.380
I can take his head at any moment.

29:38.820 --> 29:40.100
If you persist in your defiance,

29:40.140 --> 29:42.180
I will ensure that there is not a single soul left

29:42.980 --> 29:44.900
to shed a tear for the Xiao Clan.

29:51.100 --> 29:52.340
Even with perfect timing,

29:54.020 --> 29:55.500
you still need a spark to ignite it.

29:56.380 --> 29:57.060
Xiao Hong,

29:58.500 --> 30:00.180
as long as I draw breath,

30:00.940 --> 30:01.660
Xiao Clan

30:01.940 --> 30:03.700
can forget about touching the throne.

30:15.180 --> 30:15.740
Your Lordship,

30:17.300 --> 30:18.500
standing for too long harms your bad leg.

30:19.420 --> 30:21.540
Why don't you take a seat and talk?

30:23.300 --> 30:24.060
You fool,

30:28.220 --> 30:29.980
do you truly think

30:30.060 --> 30:31.940
you are the one to end this game?

30:32.420 --> 30:33.780
What I want is simple.

30:34.660 --> 30:35.340
Withdraw your troops

30:35.940 --> 30:37.060
and leave Xiao Xun as a hostage.

30:38.660 --> 30:39.460
Your Lordship

30:40.620 --> 30:42.100
would still hold dominion over Xiaonan.

30:42.620 --> 30:43.700
It's a pity

30:44.420 --> 30:45.340
the world

30:45.460 --> 30:47.180
doesn't bend to your will alone.

30:48.540 --> 30:49.500
As things stand,

30:49.500 --> 30:51.140
even if I were willing to retreat,

30:52.660 --> 30:54.620
someone else would not allow it.

30:55.340 --> 30:57.460
Xie Yanfang has brought His Majesty

30:57.580 --> 30:58.820
to the front lines.

30:59.380 --> 31:00.740
The imperial expedition

31:00.980 --> 31:02.140
is acclaimed by all,

31:02.860 --> 31:04.060
its momentum

31:04.060 --> 31:05.340
like a rising tide.

31:06.260 --> 31:07.660
After all your planning,

31:08.420 --> 31:10.020
are you truly resigned to letting another

31:10.180 --> 31:11.300
reap the rewards?

31:12.100 --> 31:13.020
I only know

31:14.180 --> 31:15.500
that Your Lordship must accept

31:15.500 --> 31:16.260
my terms.

31:22.900 --> 31:24.540
Your Lordship broke your leg in a fall at seven,

31:25.420 --> 31:26.100
yet the late Emperor

31:26.620 --> 31:28.100
met that frailty with nothing but disdain.

31:29.260 --> 31:30.500
Having survived until today,

31:31.340 --> 31:32.620
are you truly content

31:32.900 --> 31:34.700
to die at the hands of a mere woman like me?

31:34.900 --> 31:35.300
You...

31:37.140 --> 31:38.420
Her Highness considers your situation,

31:39.220 --> 31:40.260
and has specially prepared

31:41.060 --> 31:42.220
a letter of surrender for Your Lordship.

31:42.980 --> 31:44.220
The moment Your Lordship affixes your seal,

31:44.580 --> 31:45.580
it will be dispatched to the Capital.

31:47.700 --> 31:50.540
If I can surrender my son

31:50.620 --> 31:52.460
to suppress this rebellion,

31:54.060 --> 31:55.820
what can you possibly offer me?

32:00.340 --> 32:01.740
How does the title

32:02.100 --> 32:02.980
of the Prince of State sound

32:03.580 --> 32:04.180
to Your Lordship?

32:38.260 --> 32:40.100
The first sentence in Her Highness's letter

32:41.100 --> 32:42.500
certainly gets straight to the point.

32:46.380 --> 32:47.860
This war must not come to pass.

32:51.060 --> 32:52.060
Her Highness states

32:52.980 --> 32:53.740
she has captured

32:53.740 --> 32:55.500
the heir to the Lord of Xiaonan, Xiao Xun,

32:55.780 --> 32:58.100
and by holding the life of the Xiao Clan over his head,

32:58.860 --> 33:00.620
she has forced the Lord to withdraw his troops.

33:01.460 --> 33:02.380
She only asks the imperial court

33:02.380 --> 33:04.300
to pardon their sins,

33:05.260 --> 33:07.420
requiring only that Xiao Xun enter the Capital as a hostage,

33:08.420 --> 33:10.740
and that the Prince of Xiaonan be granted the title of Prince of State.

33:12.820 --> 33:13.900
Is Her Highness being

33:14.020 --> 33:15.180
too lenient?

33:15.820 --> 33:16.860
Not punishing them is one thing,

33:17.380 --> 33:19.180
but to grant him an even higher title?

33:20.020 --> 33:20.460
Absurd.

33:20.940 --> 33:21.940
Treason is a grave crime.

33:22.380 --> 33:23.340
How could it be so easily pardoned?

33:23.820 --> 33:25.100
In my view,

33:25.260 --> 33:26.580
the Lord of Xiaonan should return

33:26.900 --> 33:29.300
to the Capital to beg for forgiveness.

33:29.980 --> 33:30.820
- Right. - Yes.

33:31.860 --> 33:33.460
Her Highness argues in her letter:

33:34.220 --> 33:35.940
"While the court's forces are strong,

33:36.420 --> 33:38.060
the Northern Desert is restless.

33:39.340 --> 33:41.300
The Lord of Xiaonan has long harbored treasonous designs.

33:42.060 --> 33:43.340
If the conflict drags on,

33:43.420 --> 33:44.660
I fear the state will be plunged into chaos

33:44.740 --> 33:45.620
for decades.

33:46.020 --> 33:47.980
The Lord of Xiaonan covets the throne but lacks the spine for it.

33:48.220 --> 33:49.340
If his edge is blunted,

33:49.620 --> 33:50.940
he will surely tread with extreme caution.

33:51.420 --> 33:51.980
Therefore,

33:52.980 --> 33:54.340
the court can subdue the enemy

33:54.900 --> 33:56.220
without a war."

33:56.780 --> 33:58.300
A victory without a war is like

33:58.700 --> 34:00.740
merits going unnoticed.

34:00.900 --> 34:01.860
Even if we are willing,

34:02.300 --> 34:03.340
would Mr. Xie be?

34:03.780 --> 34:04.260
Now that

34:04.580 --> 34:06.020
His Majesty has assembled the forces

34:06.100 --> 34:07.620
for an imperial expedition,

34:08.180 --> 34:09.060
negotiating peace secretly

34:09.180 --> 34:10.460
with the Lord of Xiaonan

34:11.060 --> 34:12.700
would bring unimaginable infamy upon us.

34:15.060 --> 34:17.140
Mr. Deng, what gives you such support,

34:17.460 --> 34:19.180
enough to rival the Xie Clan,

34:19.780 --> 34:21.140
is the late Emperor's dying wish

34:21.580 --> 34:22.900
to place the Imperial Seal in your hands.

34:24.300 --> 34:25.660
It is not you they follow,

34:26.300 --> 34:27.820
but the power behind you.

34:29.460 --> 34:31.020
In war and peace, it is the generals who hold sway.

34:31.500 --> 34:32.220
A commander in the field

34:32.580 --> 34:33.820
need not always heed the Emperor's orders.

34:35.020 --> 34:36.740
If even an imperial command can be refused,

34:37.420 --> 34:38.860
what then of a regent's authority?

34:40.500 --> 34:41.260
So, Mr. Deng,

34:42.340 --> 34:44.140
do you intend to serve in an age of chaos

34:44.700 --> 34:46.380
or an age of prosperity?

34:56.780 --> 34:57.500
Draft the decree.

34:59.820 --> 35:00.340
Yes.

35:11.580 --> 35:12.660
The Northern Desert is encroaching,

35:12.900 --> 35:14.020
and His Majesty is leading the army in person.

35:14.700 --> 35:16.100
The Lord of Xiaonan intended to dispatch troops

35:16.220 --> 35:17.300
to garrison the Capital.

35:18.020 --> 35:19.380
However, Xiao Xun,

35:19.500 --> 35:19.860
in...

35:22.540 --> 35:23.700
his obstinate defiance,

35:23.980 --> 35:25.060
harbored treasonous designs.

35:25.580 --> 35:28.220
By commanding Xiao Xun to the Capital to face justice,

35:28.820 --> 35:30.220
the Prince of Xiaonan has placed duty above blood,

35:30.300 --> 35:31.380
a loyalty most commendable.

35:31.700 --> 35:34.140
The title of Prince of State is hereby conferred upon him,

35:34.500 --> 35:35.780
in recognition of his fealty.

35:48.340 --> 35:49.500
Your Highness, please rise.

36:00.300 --> 36:04.340
Father has cast me aside.

36:04.940 --> 36:06.300
His Lordship had no other choices.

36:06.900 --> 36:08.660
Please do not hold a grudge against His Lordship.

36:10.660 --> 36:12.060
Why would I?

36:15.220 --> 36:15.940
A sacrificed piece

36:17.500 --> 36:19.300
must know its place.

36:19.820 --> 36:21.860
Chu Zhao has set an inescapable trap.

36:22.820 --> 36:23.900
Be careful on your way

36:25.220 --> 36:26.540
to the Capital, Your Highness.

36:33.020 --> 36:34.260
Chu Zhao.

36:51.460 --> 36:52.940
Are you certain it is safe now?

36:53.140 --> 36:53.740
Rest assured.

36:53.900 --> 36:54.860
It has been safe for some time.

36:58.220 --> 36:59.220
Mr. Chu,

36:59.420 --> 37:00.940
there is still a grand undertaking waiting for you.

37:01.540 --> 37:02.060
Grand undertaking?

37:02.820 --> 37:03.500
What is that?

37:03.900 --> 37:04.780
Her Highness says

37:04.820 --> 37:05.500
you are to accompany

37:05.500 --> 37:06.700
Xiao Xun back to the Capital.

37:07.420 --> 37:09.100
Having achieved such a monumental success,

37:09.180 --> 37:10.260
​you should go and see​ His Majesty

37:10.340 --> 37:11.140
​to receive your rewards.

37:12.100 --> 37:12.580
That's right.

37:13.060 --> 37:14.100
We did render our service.

37:14.500 --> 37:15.860
We deserve a reward.

37:16.580 --> 37:17.020
Go.

37:17.340 --> 37:18.060
Let's claim it.

37:19.500 --> 37:20.220
Darling,

37:20.580 --> 37:21.580
do you truly wish to go?

37:21.860 --> 37:23.860
Could this be another errand to our deaths?

37:24.460 --> 37:24.820
Wait.

37:25.340 --> 37:26.340
We risked our lives

37:26.500 --> 37:27.620
for this.

37:27.940 --> 37:29.140
It is real.

37:29.420 --> 37:30.700
Father, remember to ask His Majesty

37:30.700 --> 37:31.500
for plenty of rewards.

37:32.340 --> 37:33.060
After all,

37:34.380 --> 37:35.900
I did give up a chance

37:35.900 --> 37:37.140
to marry into power.

37:37.340 --> 37:38.060
That's for sure.

37:38.500 --> 37:39.660
- Let's go claim our rewards. - Alright.

37:40.820 --> 37:41.340
Hold on tight.

37:41.500 --> 37:42.340
Mother, easy.

37:42.580 --> 37:43.340
Hurry.

37:44.780 --> 37:48.340
Greetings, Your Majesty.

37:49.900 --> 37:50.620
You may rise.

37:51.380 --> 37:52.980
Thank you, Your Majesty.

37:55.420 --> 37:56.860
Mr. Deng, I appreciate your tireless dedication

37:57.020 --> 37:57.540
to affairs of state.

37:58.540 --> 38:00.140
Guarding the state for Your Majesty

38:00.700 --> 38:01.900
is my duty.

38:02.500 --> 38:03.580
With you presiding over the court,

38:04.300 --> 38:05.660
I was able to march with peace of mind.

38:06.420 --> 38:06.940
You have earned

38:07.340 --> 38:08.100
great merit.

38:13.060 --> 38:13.780
Your Majesty,

38:14.780 --> 38:16.180
where is Mr. Xie?

38:16.500 --> 38:17.540
He offered to remain

38:17.540 --> 38:18.500
in Xiaonan Prefecture to handle the aftermath.

38:19.460 --> 38:20.780
He will return to the Capital

38:21.300 --> 38:22.220
once the situation is settled.

38:23.060 --> 38:24.020
Given the gravity of the matter,

38:24.900 --> 38:26.420
would it be wise to leave it

38:26.820 --> 38:28.100
entirely to Mr. Xie?

38:28.500 --> 38:30.140
He is my own flesh and blood.

38:30.820 --> 38:31.980
How could it not be appropriate?

38:32.980 --> 38:34.180
Do you doubt

38:34.500 --> 38:35.700
his ability to manage

38:35.700 --> 38:36.900
the affairs of Xiaonan Prefecture?

38:38.980 --> 38:40.540
I would not dare to speak recklessly.

38:40.820 --> 38:43.300
Everything is at Your Majesty's discretion.

38:44.460 --> 38:45.460
The imperial uncle's carriage

38:45.620 --> 38:46.460
has entered the city.

38:46.900 --> 38:47.940
I leave

38:48.340 --> 38:49.580
the rest to your discretion.

38:50.140 --> 38:52.020
Yes, Your Majesty.

38:58.620 --> 39:00.620
[The Capital]

39:05.420 --> 39:06.780
Send His Highness to the side residence.

39:07.580 --> 39:08.580
Assign more guards

39:09.020 --> 39:10.740
and ensure His Highness is well cared for.

39:11.140 --> 39:11.580
Yes.

39:42.780 --> 39:44.180
Long live His Majesty!

39:44.420 --> 39:46.380
The rebels of Xiaonan Prefecture are repelled

39:46.740 --> 39:48.540
and the State of Chu is preserved

39:48.620 --> 39:50.500
for eternity!

39:50.940 --> 39:52.540
"For eternity"?

39:55.340 --> 39:57.060
They actually treat Your Highness as a prisoner.

39:57.820 --> 39:59.020
A defeated enemy

40:00.060 --> 40:01.500
deserves no courtesies.

40:02.380 --> 40:03.940
It should have been Your Highness entering the city in triumph.

40:04.340 --> 40:05.620
Chu Zhao used you as a hostage,

40:06.100 --> 40:07.540
and His Lordship had no choice but to retreat his troops,

40:07.820 --> 40:08.620
wasting all his efforts.

40:09.660 --> 40:10.660
Did Father call back his troops

40:11.620 --> 40:12.820
for my sake,

40:13.300 --> 40:14.380
or for his reputation?

40:15.700 --> 40:17.340
We both know the answer.

40:18.620 --> 40:19.340
But it doesn't matter.

40:20.540 --> 40:21.780
Even if my father has no regard for me,

40:22.380 --> 40:23.500
I still have to play the dutiful son,

40:24.460 --> 40:25.340
don't I?

40:25.820 --> 40:26.380
Your Highness.

40:27.300 --> 40:28.260
No need for comfort.

40:29.660 --> 40:31.660
Chu Zhao's scheme was brilliant.

40:33.020 --> 40:35.100
First, she used the Longwei Army to threaten Father

40:35.380 --> 40:36.620
into hesitation,

40:37.060 --> 40:38.500
then she joined forces with Xie Yanfang

40:39.460 --> 40:41.340
to deceive my nephew

40:42.100 --> 40:43.380
into leading an imperial expedition.

40:44.380 --> 40:46.180
Father has been so cautious

40:47.700 --> 40:49.340
that he would not risk sending troops.

40:50.180 --> 40:51.100
How could His Lordship do this?

40:51.700 --> 40:52.580
Father has valued

40:53.660 --> 40:55.860
a rightful name above all else his entire life.

40:57.380 --> 40:58.020
Yet,

40:58.660 --> 41:00.600
he was nearly branded a traitor

41:00.600 --> 41:02.500
by Chu Zhao and Xie Yanfang,

41:05.140 --> 41:06.580
so he had to abandon me.

41:09.180 --> 41:10.580
My mistake

41:12.380 --> 41:14.060
was underestimating Chu Zhao again.

41:15.340 --> 41:16.220
I never thought

41:16.900 --> 41:19.020
she was capable of such ruthlessness,

41:20.540 --> 41:21.940
wagering me over Xiaonan Prefecture,

41:23.380 --> 41:24.420
and Xiaonan Prefecture

41:26.140 --> 41:28.020
over the will of the people.

41:31.580 --> 41:32.420
If Your Highness wishes to leave,

41:33.020 --> 41:33.700
I will risk my life

41:33.700 --> 41:34.660
to escort you out of the city.

41:35.340 --> 41:36.340
Why the rush?

41:39.300 --> 41:40.700
Since we are back in the Capital,

41:42.420 --> 41:43.860
I might as well play out

41:45.020 --> 41:46.300
the rest of this game

41:46.500 --> 41:47.380
with Chu Zhao.

41:57.440 --> 42:02.040
♪Broken walls and withered branches, trapped in the mire♪

42:02.320 --> 42:04.800
♪Yet still striving to reach for the sky♪

42:04.840 --> 42:08.880
♪My pride is torn down and my body is sacrificed♪

42:11.120 --> 42:13.240
♪The spark smolders in the crack♪

42:13.320 --> 42:15.280
♪And roars in the blaze♪

42:15.360 --> 42:18.600
♪Burning the cold night until daybreak♪

42:18.760 --> 42:21.000
♪Fate imprisons me♪

42:21.160 --> 42:25.960
♪But I won't beg the abyss for mercy♪

42:25.960 --> 42:30.160
♪Even if hope is faint, I remain proud♪

42:30.160 --> 42:34.440
♪A mayfly will cross the ocean, however long it takes♪

42:34.440 --> 42:39.880
♪However it ends up, I'll go my own way♪

42:39.880 --> 42:41.840
♪With no fear of the distance♪

42:41.840 --> 42:45.560
♪Born from decay, fireflies still burn♪

42:45.560 --> 42:50.000
♪With sword in hand, I'll pierce the dawn♪

42:50.000 --> 42:55.360
♪Let these scars all over me become♪

42:55.360 --> 42:58.960
♪My new pride♪

43:13.760 --> 43:16.640
♪Peril is everywhere in the palace♪

43:16.640 --> 43:19.160
♪Yet I smile to nobody but you♪

43:19.160 --> 43:21.520
♪Amidst the chaos♪

43:21.520 --> 43:25.800
♪I'll always be with you♪

43:27.240 --> 43:29.360
♪The spark smolders in the crack♪

43:29.440 --> 43:31.400
♪And roars in the blaze♪

43:31.480 --> 43:34.720
♪Burning the cold night until daybreak♪

43:34.880 --> 43:37.120
♪Fate imprisons me♪

43:37.280 --> 43:42.080
♪But I won't beg the abyss for mercy♪

43:42.080 --> 43:46.280
♪Even if hope is faint, I remain proud♪

43:46.280 --> 43:50.560
♪A mayfly will cross the ocean, however long it takes♪

43:50.560 --> 43:56.000
♪However it ends up, I'll go my own way♪

43:56.000 --> 43:57.960
♪With no fear of the distance♪

43:57.960 --> 44:01.680
♪Born from decay, fireflies still burn♪

44:01.680 --> 44:06.120
♪With sword in hand, I'll pierce the dawn♪

44:06.120 --> 44:11.480
♪Let these scars all over me become♪

44:11.480 --> 44:15.080
♪My new pride♪
